# Serene Ultra — English (US) shader menu labels

screen.QUALITY = Quality & Profiles
screen.COLOR = Color & HDR Controls

option.SHADOW_ALPHA_CUTOFF = Shadow Alpha Cutoff
option.AO_STRENGTH = Contact AO Strength
option.AO_RADIUS = Contact AO Radius
option.RED_GAIN = Red Channel
option.GREEN_GAIN = Green Channel
option.BLUE_GAIN = Blue Channel
option.GAMMA = Gamma
option.EXPOSURE = Exposure
option.CONTRAST = Contrast
option.SATURATION = Saturation
option.HDR_LOOK = HDR Tone Mapping

option.SHADOW_ALPHA_CUTOFF.comment = Controls which transparent texels are removed from shadow casters. Lower values preserve finer foliage detail.
option.AO_STRENGTH.comment = Controls local screen-space contact shading. AO affects ambient light only.
option.AO_RADIUS.comment = Sets the view-space radius used to detect nearby occluding surfaces. Larger values affect broader contact regions.
option.RED_GAIN.comment = Adjust the red channel independently. 1.00 is neutral.
option.GREEN_GAIN.comment = Adjust the green channel independently. 1.00 is neutral.
option.BLUE_GAIN.comment = Adjust the blue channel independently. 1.00 is neutral.
option.GAMMA.comment = Display gamma correction. 1.00 is neutral.
option.EXPOSURE.comment = Brightness adjustment in photographic stops.
option.CONTRAST.comment = Adjust contrast around middle gray.
option.SATURATION.comment = Adjust color intensity. 1.00 is neutral; 0.00 is monochrome.
option.HDR_LOOK.comment = HDR-style tone mapping for SDR output. This does not enable operating-system or monitor HDR output.

value.HDR_LOOK.0 = Neutral
value.HDR_LOOK.1 = HDR
value.HDR_LOOK.2 = Ultra HDR

profile.comment = Ultra-Light: lower shadow cost while retaining effects. Smooth: balanced shadow quality. Ultra: full shadow-distance target. HDR: Ultra with HDR-style tone mapping. Ultra-HDR: stronger highlight compression and HDR-style presentation. All profiles retain the complete planned feature set.

option.WATER_FOG_MULT = Water depth opacity
option.WATER_FOG_MULT.comment = Controls how quickly water becomes opaque with depth.
